3. Calculate the projection of $\overrightarrow{BA}$ onto $\mathbf{v}$ to find the point on the line closest to $A$:
   The projection of $\overrightarrow{BA}$ onto $\mathbf{v}$ is given by
   \begin{equation}
   \text{proj}_{\mathbf{v}} \overrightarrow{BA} = \frac{\overrightarrow{BA} \cdot \mathbf{v}}{\left\| \mathbf{v} \right\|^2} \mathbf{v}.
   \end{equation}

   The dot product $\overrightarrow{BA} \cdot \mathbf{v}$ is
   \begin{equation}
