   \end{equation}

   The square of the magnitude of $\mathbf{v}$ is
   \begin{equation}
   \left\| \mathbf{v} \right\|^2 = 2^2 + (-2)^2 + (-4)^2 = 4 + 4 + 16 = 24.
   \end{equation}

   Thus, the projection of $\overrightarrow{BA}$ onto $\mathbf{v}$ is
   \begin{equation}
